  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ukraine Local Empowerment, Accountability and Development Programme Phase II (ULEAD II)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of Ukraine Local Empowerment Accountability and Development programme phase II (U-LEAD II) is to contribute to further advancement of multilevel governance in Ukraine, which is transparent, accountable and responsive to the needs of the population.

Denmark has supported U-LEAD Phase I since 2016 and the second phase provides continued instrumental support to decentralisation and local government reform.</narrative>
  </description>
